  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate 200-mm wafer-scale photonic heterogeneous integration platform comprising TFLN modulator and hydrogen-free SiN using die-to-wafer bonding. High-efficiency light transmission between SiN and TFLN waveguides is demonstrated using MZI modulator with 2.9 V·cm modulation efficiency.</jats:p>",
